stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ISSUED: POST /v1/actions
    ISSUED --> REDEEMED: secret matches - owner matches<br/>- elapsed >= min_duration - proof ok - caps ok
    ISSUED --> EXPIRED: clock_timestamp() > expires_at<br/>(on access, plus an hourly sweeper)
    ISSUED --> VOID: user opens a ticket beyond max_open_tickets<br/>or validation failed (too fast / proof rejected)
    REDEEMED --> [*]: terminal - a replay returns the original outcome
    EXPIRED --> [*]
    VOID --> [*]
